  //   (0, 11, -3) against the raised block's near face, (0, 10, -3) and (0, 10, -2) in a line
  //   from the wall toward the camera, (-1, 10, -2) and (-2, 10, -2) branching off to the left,
  //   (1, 10, -2) to the right and (0, 10, -1) toward the camera, and a lone pane at (2, 10, -1).
  // Each pane reaches an arm toward every neighboring pane or dirt block (PaneShape), so the
  // line meets the wall, (0, 10, -2) is a full cross, the upper pane is a post with one arm into
  // the raised block, the row ends stop at their posts and the lone pane is just a post:
  //   panes-front    from where the player stands, with the HUD and the selection outline
  //   lone-before    the lone pane at world x 255, the last column of its chunk: a bare post
  //   lone-border    a dirt block placed east of it, at x 256 across the chunk border: the pane
